Sporting a distinctive military olive-green and grey camouflage paint scheme, "Gamma" retained the powerful pneumatic jackhammers attached to its forearms. Tony upgraded the suit with specialized radiation shielding and reinforced thermal lining, enabling it to operate safely in intense gamma radiation zones, toxic waste spills, and high-heat environments.

In Iron Man 3, Mark XXVI deploys alongside the rest of the Iron Legion during the House Party Protocol at the Norco oil rig, engaging Extremis forces before being destroyed in the final "Clean Slate" detonation order.
